      "Non-inferiority was demonstrated against a margin of minus 5.5 per cent.",
      "294 haematological and 1,036 non-haematological adverse events were documented in the four-cycle group against 426 and 1,280 in the six-cycle group.",
      "Two patients died during study therapy, both in the six-cycle group.",
